Z||000000||Nyte||05-02-2001||08:30 PM||||How would someone go about lifting a Fiero?  Like a suspension lift kit.<P>Kind of like this...<P> <IMG SRC="http://sndfr.homestead.com/files/offroad_fiero.jpg"> <P>But more clean like this...<P> <IMG SRC="http://sndfr.homestead.com/files/jalapeno.jpg"> <P>(that yellow thing is the Jalapeno body kit from PISA, they raised the Fiero three inches with a suspension kit but they only give the company name, not any "how-to's")<P>------------------<BR><B>Matthew "Whyt Nyte" D.</B><BR><B><I>84 SE</B>- automatic, rare Fender Delete option "Fender gap?  What fender gap?"</I><P>"Damned '84 econo coupes!  Why didn't you guys tell me this BEFORE I bought the dang thing!"||||reg||7
