Z||000009||saleenfiero||05-03-2001||01:27 PM||||I think the Jalapeno would rock if you have like a few other fieros too and want something different.  In kit car mag, it looked even better, I think a bit more of a raise on a normal fiero suspension, sort of akin to a dune buggy.  Any it had two completely different style just from the wheels being changed.  It had 20" rims for a cruiser look and then switched to 15" mudboggers for the offroad look.<P>------------------<BR>'86 SE - My car is actually a MacLaren F1 with a Fiero body kit; or not.||||reg||1
